{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Available in Q2 2025</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601580/extras/power_wash_steam___4_.gif?t=1744200372\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this DLC, you\u2019ll become a cleaning specialist, armed with a pressure washer to restore order to the prison walls. Mysterious stains, mold, graffiti \u2013 17 unique locations await, including:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Death Row \u2013 because the last moments should be in a hygienic setting.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Execution Room \u2013 starting off with a blast\u2026 literally!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cafeteria &amp; Kitchen \u2013 you'd rather not ask where those stains come from.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Showers \u2013 what happens here\u2026 stays here.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601580/extras/power_wash_steam__1_.gif?t=1744200372\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your tools:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A pressure washer with four different nozzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A progress bar so you know how close you are to spotless perfection.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A relaxing game mode \u2013 no daily prison duties, just the satisfaction of cleaning.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">New Steam achievements, because someone should recognize your hard work!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601580/extras/power_wash_steam___2_.gif?t=1744200372\" /><br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Guards and inmates may complain, but a clean prison is a better prison.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Grab your pressure washer and get to work \u2013 this mess won\u2019t clean itself!<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601580/extras/power_wash_steam___3_.gif?t=1744200372\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3601580?t=1744200372","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3601580?t=1744200372","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601580/957f8e6e374abe4b90c6a9876dbb1455fe95daee/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744200372","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601580/957f8e6e374abe4b90c6a9876dbb1455fe95daee/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744200372","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Trading Cards","id":29},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Available in Q2 2025</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601580/extras/power_wash_steam___4_.gif?t=1744200372\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this DLC, you\u2019ll become a cleaning specialist, armed with a pressure washer to restore order to the prison walls. Mysterious stains, mold, graffiti \u2013 17 unique locations await, including:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Death Row \u2013 because the last moments should be in a hygienic setting.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Execution Room \u2013 starting off with a blast\u2026 literally!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cafeteria &amp; Kitchen \u2013 you'd